# READYGO FRONTEND DESIGN SYSTEM & UI ARCHITECTURE RULES

## 1. TOGGLE SWITCH STANDARDS
- Binary Selection Switch (`BinaryToggle`): Used for non-OFF choices (Run/Cycle, Loop/Point-to-Point). Track `60x18px`, Knob `24px` (#BACBC9 left, #7CFF00 right).
- Boolean ON/OFF Switch (`BooleanToggle`): Used for feature toggles. Track `60x18px`, Knob `24px` (#BACBC9 OFF, #7CFF00 ON).

## 2. MODAL & OVERLAY SHEET ARCHITECTURE
- Backdrop: `fixed inset-0 bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-md z-[100] flex flex-col justify-end`.
- Sheet: `w-full max-w-md mx-auto bg-[#182629] border-t border-[#2D3739] rounded-t-[24px] p-6 text-[#BACBC9] shadow-2xl relative z-[101]`.
- Top-Right Close Icon: `<XCircle className="w-6 h-6 text-[#BACBC9]/60 hover:text-white cursor-pointer absolute top-6 right-6 z-[102]"/>`.

## 3. CONTAINER & PILL SPACING
- Setup Cards: `w-full bg-[#182629]/40 border border-[#2D3739]/60 rounded-[4px] p-4 mb-[10px] flex flex-col items-start`.
- Pill Rows: `flex flex-wrap justify-start items-center gap-[10px] w-full mt-2`.
- Active Pill: `border-[#70FF00] text-[#70FF00] bg-[#70FF00]/10 font-bold`.

## 4. SETTINGS HUB & SAVED
- Settings Hub: No top-right close icon (bottom nav owns exit). Individual card rows: `w-full bg-[#182629]/60 hover:bg-[#182629] border border-[#2D3739]/60 rounded-[4px] mb-[5px] p-4 flex justify-between items-center`.
- Section Headers: `text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 mt-4`.
- Color Lock: Delete all my data `#FBBC05` (amber). Delete my account `#FF3B3B` (danger red).
- Child settings forms (handle/password): Top-left `<ArrowLeftCircle className="w-6 h-6 text-[#BACBC9]" />` back to `/settings`.
- Saved Hub titles: `{count} / SAVED SESSIONS` or `{count} / SAVED PROFILES` (no bracket/max-cap copy). No modal close X inside the SAVED tab.
